backend/kb/chroma_index/
*.onnx
.cache/

# ── OS / editor noise ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# ── Raw yearbook PDFs (234 MB) — added by B after nearly committing them ──
# docs/NOTES.md #3 is explicit that raw yearbook data is "hosted publicly, link in
# README", not carried in git. 2016.pdf alone is 53 MB, past GitHub's warning
# threshold; the set would bloat every clone and slow the one push that has to
# work before the cutoff. A: if you disagree, this is one line to delete — but
# please use a public link + README reference instead.
1. Yearbook/
*.pdf

# NOTE (B): data/crop.db is deliberately NOT ignored here — docs/archive/hackathon/PLAN.md §1 leaves
# "gitignored or committed with meta timestamp" to A. A decides; B does not.

# ── Session/farm memory store (A) — runtime state, not source, never committed ──
backend/memory/memory.db
backend/memory/memory.db-*

